.netlify/

# Service-account / admin-SDK private keys. This repo is PUBLIC and serves
# GitHub Pages, so a key committed here is published permanently and must be
# treated as compromised, not just deleted. Keys live outside the repo; these
# patterns exist only to catch a mistake.
*-adminsdk-*.json
*iam.gserviceaccount*.json
service-account*.json
godmusclegears-[0-9]*.json
